      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">توتّر</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>It</i> (a sinew, or nerve, T, M, A, K,
and a vein, M, TA, not the neck, for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العُنُقُ</span> in
the K is a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِرْقُ</span>, TA) <i>became tense,</i>
(M, K, TA,) <i>like a bow-string.</i> (M, TA.)

